error_signature: "cannot guess build type.*config.guess timestamp = 200[0-9]|unable to guess system type.*HarmonyOS"
root_cause: "老版（2006-2008）config.guess 的 HarmonyOS 分支有两个坑：①补丁常写成 `*:HarmonyOS:*:*` 四段模式，但 OHOS 的 uname -v 形如 `#1 SMP Wed Apr 29 10:16:03 UTC 2026`（含冒号），case 字符串被拆成 5+ 段导致模式不匹配；②老版 config.guess 不通过变量输出，而是每个分支 `echo <triplet>; exit 0`，只赋值 GUESS 不 echo 会继续走兜底 CC 探测并最终 `unable to guess system type`（rc=1）。"
rec_approach: "config.guess 用 `*:HarmonyOS:*)` 三段模式 + `echo ${MACHINE}-unknown-linux-ohos; exit 0`；同时在 config.sub 侧补齐 linux-ohos*（maybe_os 列表）、aarch64（CPU 列表）、aarch64-*（cpu-company 列表）、-linux-ohos（os 分支），否则 host 校验报 `machine aarch64-linux not recognized`。"
rec_command: "perl ${SKILL_ROOT}/scripts/patch-autotools-ohos.pl config.guess config.sub && ./config.guess && ./config.sub aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos"
match_keywords: ["config.guess", "HarmonyOS", "cannot guess build type", "unable to guess system type", "uname -v colon", "triplet", "config.sub", "linux-ohos", "aarch64"]
error_excerpt: "config.guess: unable to guess system type ... UNAME_VERSION = #1 SMP Wed Apr 29 10:16:03 UTC 2026"
severity: P1
category: autotools
last_updated: 2026-09-30
source_event: "maq/0.7.1 适配（configure 第一阶段失败 → 0001/0002 补丁）"
